WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:48.210 --> 01:50.130
Hey, can I...?

01:50.130 --> 01:51.250
A little more!

01:52.050 --> 01:54.010
Wait a sec!

01:54.010 --> 01:55.210
Okay, now!

02:00.720 --> 02:02.680
What is this, a computer?

02:04.220 --> 02:05.680
Tolerating the intolerable...

02:05.680 --> 02:07.390
Bearing the unbearable...

02:07.390 --> 02:09.020
Against rain and wind...

02:09.020 --> 02:11.110
Withstanding the Superintendent's sarcasm...

02:11.110 --> 02:15.570
We finally got our own computer!

02:17.820 --> 02:20.570
- What? You're not surprised?

02:19.530 --> 02:20.570
- Yeah! Yeah!

02:20.570 --> 02:22.990
How do you want me to react?

02:22.990 --> 02:28.540
By inputting all the data concerning past Jeanne cases and analyzing it,

02:28.540 --> 02:33.960
our department's power is going to absolutely, positively, undoubtedly increase!

02:33.960 --> 02:36.460
Yeah? With just that...?

02:36.460 --> 02:39.930
You're not an expert investigator, so you wouldn't understand.

02:40.640 --> 02:42.090
Let me explain:

02:42.090 --> 02:47.930
For example, from the data of crime scenes, time, victims and stolen items...

02:47.930 --> 02:52.940
...you can estimate what the criminal's personality, age and physical features are.

02:52.940 --> 02:54.190
Really?

02:54.190 --> 02:55.900
Watch this.

02:58.400 --> 03:02.910
Kaitou Jeanne Elimination Order!!

03:10.210 --> 03:12.500
She's just a mere human.

03:12.500 --> 03:15.590
She's neither exceptionally beautiful nor strong.

03:15.590 --> 03:19.130
I shouldn't even have to deal with this!

03:19.130 --> 03:22.550
It's just that God is protecting her...

03:22.550 --> 03:24.510
Is that the only reason?

03:27.680 --> 03:30.980
Yeah! If it weren't for God's protection, Jeanne would be...!

03:30.980 --> 03:35.730
However, it's not going to go away. Probably not ever.

03:35.730 --> 03:37.480
I know.

03:37.480 --> 03:41.610
That's why I've been planning strategies and attacking Jeanne from the sidelines.

03:41.610 --> 03:45.780
But you, Noin... What have you done?

03:45.780 --> 03:48.540
I just want to take my time.

03:49.410 --> 03:52.540
With a single shot into her heart.

03:53.830 --> 03:57.420
I hate your condescending way of talking!

04:06.220 --> 04:08.890
Could you display the map?

04:08.890 --> 04:10.020
Like this?

04:14.520 --> 04:18.690
What's the matter? Did you already figure out the culprit?

04:18.690 --> 04:20.740
Display the stolen items too, please.

04:20.740 --> 04:21.900
Yes, ma'am.

04:27.120 --> 04:29.290
I got it!

04:29.290 --> 04:32.460
Jeanne almost always attacks Momokuri City residents!

04:32.460 --> 04:38.750
Even more significantly, recent data shows a concentration between Momokuri Academy and our apartment.

04:38.750 --> 04:41.920
However, there are no common elements among the stolen goods.

04:41.920 --> 04:43.380
This is a huge clue.

04:44.840 --> 04:46.840
You don't have any idea!

04:46.840 --> 04:51.520
You idiot! Why does Jeanne only commit crimes in this city?

04:51.520 --> 04:57.060
Why does she steal such a variety of objects, from world-class treasures to useless trash.

04:57.060 --> 05:01.530
Once these mysteries are solved, we'll know what kind of person Jeanne is like!

05:01.530 --> 05:03.070
Ah, I get it.

05:03.070 --> 05:06.490
I wonder what her purpose is...?

05:06.490 --> 05:08.370
Yeah, I wonder, too.

05:10.280 --> 05:12.950
<i>What are the Demons after?</i>

05:16.620 --> 05:18.380
What a stupid girl.

05:18.380 --> 05:20.340
You don't know anything, do you?

05:22.630 --> 05:26.090
Could she have some kind of grudge against Momokuri City?

05:26.090 --> 05:27.010
Grudge?

05:28.050 --> 05:32.100
So that's why she's committing crimes against the people! That's horrible.

05:32.100 --> 05:37.520
Wait a minute. Jeanne doesn't seem to be the vindictive type.

05:37.520 --> 05:39.230
She does it for fun?

05:39.230 --> 05:40.860
That seems more likely...

05:40.860 --> 05:41.650
Huh?

05:41.650 --> 05:44.820
Oh, it's just a guess!

05:45.700 --> 05:48.530
What if there's more than one Jeanne?

05:49.570 --> 05:51.240
A Black Jeanne...

05:51.240 --> 05:52.490
...and a Super Jeanne...

05:52.490 --> 05:54.500
...or maybe Jeanne has a twin?

05:54.500 --> 05:55.790
You idiot.

05:55.790 --> 06:00.750
Why would so many Jeannes concentrate in one place?

06:00.750 --> 06:02.750
It's a challenge against the police!

06:02.750 --> 06:07.590
Such an act may be forgiven by others, but I, Toudaiji Miyako, would never forgive that!

06:07.590 --> 06:08.970
Exactly!

06:08.970 --> 06:09.640
Us, too!

06:11.600 --> 06:15.310
By the way, where's your father?

06:16.430 --> 06:19.900
Was he called into headquarters?

06:19.900 --> 06:22.940
He's in a worse place than headquarters.

06:22.940 --> 06:24.480
A worse place?

06:24.480 --> 06:26.070
Much closer, though.

06:30.360 --> 06:31.530
Ah, here it is.

06:32.870 --> 06:34.490
This is a horrible situation.

06:34.490 --> 06:39.710
As the Superintendent, I have to worry about money problems.

06:39.710 --> 06:41.630
Do you know what this is?

06:41.630 --> 06:42.500
Uh...

06:42.500 --> 06:46.380
Yes, it's the bill for the newly installed computer in the Jeanne Investigation Headquarters.

06:46.380 --> 06:47.550
That's a worthy...

06:47.550 --> 06:51.510
Yes, the purchase is for a worthy cause.

06:51.510 --> 06:54.560
There is a cost issue here, though.

06:54.560 --> 06:59.770
Honestly, this computer is not going to waste, is it?

06:59.770 --> 07:01.850
I give you my word.

07:01.850 --> 07:03.900
Can I believe that?

07:03.900 --> 07:10.030
It took lots of money to build the last seventeen special Anti-Jeanne Inventions, and that was bad enough.

07:11.360 --> 07:14.870
Is that thing hanging from your chest a toy?

07:15.830 --> 07:18.250
I will do my best!

07:18.250 --> 07:24.420
I hope you do. Funding alone is enough of a headache.

07:27.510 --> 07:30.010
He hasn't said anything for a while.

07:30.010 --> 07:31.880
He is a very timid person.

07:31.880 --> 07:37.430
Just watch. Now that we have a computer, arresting Jeanne is only a matter of time.

07:40.980 --> 07:43.190
Well then, excuse me.

07:55.990 --> 07:57.990
What's the matter?

07:57.990 --> 08:01.580
Are you lost? The entrance is...

08:01.580 --> 08:03.420
Are you going to catch Jeanne?

08:03.420 --> 08:05.460
Huh? Yes...

08:05.460 --> 08:07.750
Doing your best isn't enough.

08:07.750 --> 08:11.050
You have to sell your soul to the Devil.

08:33.990 --> 08:36.280
Fin! Fin!

08:38.240 --> 08:40.120
Today is no good, either.

08:40.120 --> 08:43.210
Why was I able to connect last time?

08:43.210 --> 08:47.960
I thought Fin would have a clue what the Demons are after.

08:47.960 --> 08:50.590
Miyako is so enthusiastic, too. What should I do?

09:00.930 --> 09:02.770
Oji-sama?

09:00.930 --> 09:02.770
Oji-sama = Uncle

09:02.770 --> 09:03.430
It couldn't be...

09:04.310 --> 09:05.980
Oh, Dad!

09:05.980 --> 09:10.110
How was it? Was the Superintendent filling your ears up with complaints again?

09:10.110 --> 09:13.780
It wasn't much. It wasn't even worth listening to.

09:13.780 --> 09:14.860
Huh?

09:14.860 --> 09:17.240
We don't have any time left!

09:17.240 --> 09:19.780
We're going full-force on the Jeanne Investigation.

09:19.780 --> 09:21.620
Dad...!

09:21.620 --> 09:23.410
Jeanne is evil!

09:23.410 --> 09:26.370
We must...terminate her!

09:26.370 --> 09:27.750
Terminate...!

09:27.750 --> 09:30.210
You're going to kill her?! Hold on, Dad!

09:30.210 --> 09:35.380
Jeanne is a Kaitou, but we can't use such force without reasonable cause!

09:35.380 --> 09:37.590
Do we really need to wait for such a reason?!

09:37.590 --> 09:39.470
I don't want to kill Jeanne!

09:39.470 --> 09:41.060
I'm absolutely against it!

09:45.980 --> 09:47.520
Miyako.

09:47.520 --> 09:50.400
Humans are inherently evil beings.

09:50.400 --> 09:53.070
They make mistakes, with or without reason.

09:53.070 --> 09:57.400
In order to reduce these mistakes, the origin itself must be eliminated!

09:57.400 --> 09:58.160
That's wrong!

10:00.120 --> 10:01.160
Miyako!

10:01.160 --> 10:03.580
Dad, what's wrong with you?

10:03.580 --> 10:05.000
Why are you...?!

10:05.000 --> 10:09.500
Oji-sama, this was in front of the door.

10:11.340 --> 10:15.590
<i>"I'm taking the beauty of the policeman's soul." - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

10:17.130 --> 10:18.340
Arrogant...!

10:18.340 --> 10:20.140
Dad, please!

10:20.140 --> 10:23.600
Get out of here! I won't tolerate you talking back.

10:30.650 --> 10:36.860
The Superintendent probably said something and he felt like he had to work harder...

10:36.860 --> 10:39.160
That's why he was like that.

10:39.160 --> 10:39.820
That's not it...

10:39.820 --> 10:45.290
Dad has solved a lot of cases and received numerous awards...

10:45.290 --> 10:50.710
So I asked him which one he was proud of the most.

10:50.710 --> 10:53.960
Then, Dad showed me the palm of his hand.

10:53.960 --> 10:55.250
There was a scar.

10:55.250 --> 10:58.130
It's not as noticeable now, but...

10:58.130 --> 11:02.050
The culprit was swinging around a knife and Dad wanted to stop him...

11:02.050 --> 11:03.890
...so he suddenly grabbed the blade of the knife!

11:03.890 --> 11:07.180
His crime would have been worse if he had killed anybody, right?

11:07.180 --> 11:13.730
Dad said that he would rather hurt his hand and stopped the blade!

11:15.440 --> 11:18.110
Then, the culprit suddenly snapped out of it,

11:18.110 --> 11:22.200
looked into Dad's eyes and calmed down.

11:22.200 --> 11:25.870
He believed that his feelings got through to him.

11:25.870 --> 11:29.580
That's why he said that he was most proud of that scar.

11:29.580 --> 11:31.750
But to say something like that...

11:33.880 --> 11:36.340
It's like he wasn't Dad!

11:44.390 --> 11:47.010
T-That was close...!

12:00.740 --> 12:03.280
It's all right, Miyako.

12:03.280 --> 12:04.370
Huh?

12:04.370 --> 12:07.240
Oji-sama hasn't changed. Definitely!

12:07.240 --> 12:08.080
Maron!

12:08.080 --> 12:09.040
Hey...

12:09.040 --> 12:10.500
What the...?

12:11.830 --> 12:13.710
<i>What is the policeman's soul?</i>

12:13.710 --> 12:15.630
<i>is it Jeanne's challenge?</i>

12:15.630 --> 12:18.840
<i>What are the police planning to do?</i>

12:18.840 --> 12:22.300
<i>If something were to happen, it would hurt their reputation...</i>

12:22.300 --> 12:26.550
<i>A-Anyway, we don't intend to give Jeanne a single penny!</i>

12:26.550 --> 12:30.220
Extra! Extra, extra! Here's your extra! Extra, extra!

12:32.180 --> 12:35.150
Mysterious Notice! The Final Battle?!

12:35.150 --> 12:36.270
Chiaki!

12:36.270 --> 12:37.770
Huh? Yo.

12:37.770 --> 12:39.400
Let me see this!

12:39.400 --> 12:41.860
I'm going back!

12:41.860 --> 12:44.150
Wait, Miyako! Don't go!

12:44.150 --> 12:45.450
There's no point!

12:45.450 --> 12:48.410
That's for me to decide!

12:49.870 --> 12:52.870
There's no point in Jeanne going, either.

12:53.870 --> 12:58.000
Sending a notice to the police is nothing less than stupidity!

12:58.000 --> 13:00.840
It's only fair to send a notice!

13:00.840 --> 13:03.300
You'd just be an ordinary thief without it!

13:03.300 --> 13:05.470
That's not what I'm talking about, Maron!

13:05.470 --> 13:06.840
You're the idiot, Chiaki!

13:06.840 --> 13:07.890
Maron!

13:09.760 --> 13:10.720
Geez...

13:10.720 --> 13:12.020
You stink!

13:12.020 --> 13:13.520
What, Access?!

13:13.520 --> 13:16.350
You're supposed to say "Don't go!" in those situations!

13:16.350 --> 13:18.480
I would if I could!

13:18.480 --> 13:22.230
Well, being able to say it or not are two entirely different issues!

13:23.690 --> 13:24.450
Huh?

13:24.450 --> 13:25.360
Notice.

13:25.360 --> 13:26.200
What?!

13:26.200 --> 13:28.740
Notice! We're going too!

13:28.740 --> 13:30.120
All right!

13:41.170 --> 13:43.300
I have to hurry and become Jeanne!

13:49.350 --> 13:51.140
Hijiri-sensei...

13:52.180 --> 13:55.810
This is a stunning rosary. It is worthy of you.

13:55.810 --> 13:57.900
Thank you very much.

13:57.900 --> 13:59.730
- Please be careful.

13:58.940 --> 13:59.730
- Huh?

13:59.730 --> 14:01.730
Not to lose your rosary.

14:01.730 --> 14:05.280
Someday, it may be your last bastion of comfort.

14:05.280 --> 14:07.400
Are you a fortune teller, Sensei?

14:09.070 --> 14:11.700
You're speaking as if you're predicting the future or something...

14:11.700 --> 14:14.830
Perhaps to a certain degree. Well, then...

14:17.620 --> 14:21.750
Stupid Maron! What are you doing at a time like this?!

14:21.750 --> 14:24.000
<i>Fin, lend me your power!</i>

14:24.000 --> 14:26.220
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

14:47.610 --> 14:49.950
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:49.950 --> 14:52.030
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:52.030 --> 14:53.870
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:00.540 --> 15:04.540
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

15:15.850 --> 15:17.270
I don't care if you kill her!

15:17.270 --> 15:19.270
Don't let her get away! Got it?

15:20.230 --> 15:21.020
Yes, sir!

15:21.020 --> 15:23.310
Good! Get into your positions!

15:41.080 --> 15:42.500
What's the matter?

15:42.500 --> 15:44.380
I never thought he would ever do such a thing...

15:44.380 --> 15:46.000
I can't believe it.

15:46.000 --> 15:49.800
You idiot! Orders from superiors are absolute!

15:49.800 --> 15:53.300
Then, if you see Jeanne, are you going to do as you're told?

15:53.300 --> 15:54.300
Can you do it?

15:54.300 --> 15:56.050
Uh, well...

15:56.050 --> 15:58.470
See! You couldn't do it.

15:58.470 --> 15:59.430
- Thank you!

15:59.430 --> 16:00.520
Huh?

16:01.850 --> 16:02.640
JEANNE!!!

16:03.810 --> 16:06.610
I'm so glad you guys are such wonderful policemen!

16:07.110 --> 16:08.570
I'm going to arrest you!

16:08.570 --> 16:09.570
D-Ditto!

16:13.240 --> 16:16.450
I'm here to see Detective Toudaiji. Sorry!

16:17.160 --> 16:17.780
It's Jeanne!

16:17.780 --> 16:18.450
She went that way!

16:18.450 --> 16:19.330
Where?!

16:19.330 --> 16:20.410
Oh, Jeanne!

17:01.620 --> 17:05.370
There are two types of people in this world.

17:06.710 --> 17:09.800
Those who commit crimes and those who don't.

17:11.210 --> 17:12.170
Detective Toudaiji...

17:12.510 --> 17:16.180
There are those who deserve to live and those who don't.

17:16.390 --> 17:19.300
There's no such thing as a worthless person, Detective!

17:19.300 --> 17:21.520
You should know!

17:21.520 --> 17:25.810
Yes, for a very long time, I used to believe that there were no evil people.

17:26.100 --> 17:28.610
However, I now feel like I've woken up from a dream.

17:28.860 --> 17:32.230
No, you're dreaming right now! It is a nightmare!

17:32.230 --> 17:34.400
It doesn't matter. I don't care which it is.

17:34.400 --> 17:37.410
My dream, Jeanne, is to kill you!

17:37.910 --> 17:39.530
Oji-sama...

17:41.660 --> 17:42.910
It's the end, Jeanne.

17:49.920 --> 17:51.090
You...!

17:51.090 --> 17:52.380
Let go!

17:52.840 --> 17:55.010
I'm not letting you shoot Jeanne!

17:55.010 --> 17:57.260
WHAT?!

18:00.600 --> 18:01.720
What are you...?!

18:01.720 --> 18:02.810
Don't move, Jeanne!

18:17.740 --> 18:19.070
Geez!

18:27.250 --> 18:28.040
A Demon...!

18:32.250 --> 18:33.960
Sinbad, don't overdo it!

18:33.960 --> 18:34.420
Shut up!

18:35.840 --> 18:39.050
Jeanne! I'll take care of these two!

18:39.050 --> 18:40.640
I'm leaving the rest to you!

18:49.350 --> 18:52.060
<i>I was just one step away!</i>

18:52.060 --> 18:54.520
Too bad. You're finished!

18:54.980 --> 18:57.280
<i>Am I?</i>

19:08.120 --> 19:09.460
Here I go!

19:11.330 --> 19:15.920
<i>Even if you seal me, another Demon will come after you!</i>

19:15.920 --> 19:17.460
<i>You don't stand a chance!</i>

19:17.920 --> 19:20.550
Then why don't you come straight for me?!

19:20.550 --> 19:22.430
Why? What's so fun?!

19:22.430 --> 19:27.890
<i>Because it tortures you even more! People become evil so easily!</i>

19:28.230 --> 19:29.310
I'm not going to forgive you!

19:31.980 --> 19:36.860
People's hearts are strong! It's unforgivable that you toy with them!

19:40.990 --> 19:42.360
In the name of God...

19:44.830 --> 19:46.870
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

19:49.580 --> 19:52.370
I seal you here!

20:02.380 --> 20:03.970
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:10.930 --> 20:12.600
<i>Collection completed!</i>

20:14.350 --> 20:18.730
<i>Remember this! We'll never give up!</i>

20:18.730 --> 20:22.700
<i>We'll keep on possessing the people around you!</i>

20:24.530 --> 20:25.700
My...

20:28.580 --> 20:34.040
Jeanne has entered the station but disappeared relatively quickly.<i></i>

20:34.040 --> 20:38.380
As for the losses, they are still under investigation.<i></i>

20:42.050 --> 20:45.840
The brand new computer is...! The cost...!

20:46.260 --> 20:48.600
What should I do?

20:48.600 --> 20:49.310
Superintendant!!!!

20:51.850 --> 20:54.310
Dad! Come on, Dad!

20:56.310 --> 20:58.230
Where's Jeanne?! What happened to Jeanne?!

20:58.520 --> 21:01.190
She got away. We weren't able to catch her...

21:01.490 --> 21:04.530
- Really?! Thank goodness!

21:03.450 --> 21:04.530
- Huh?

21:04.530 --> 21:07.030
I almost lost myself.

21:07.030 --> 21:11.750
What's really important isn't punishment but to atone for your crimes.

21:11.750 --> 21:12.700
Dad!

21:12.700 --> 21:15.670
It's really you! It's the real you!

21:15.960 --> 21:17.630
Whoa, whoa! Miyako!

21:19.920 --> 21:21.050
Where's Maron?

21:29.100 --> 21:30.680
Is it my fault?

21:31.140 --> 21:35.140
Are people being possessed by Demons because I'm around?

21:35.140 --> 21:36.190
Tell me, Fin!

21:41.110 --> 21:42.980
Hijiri-sensei!

21:42.980 --> 21:44.150
What's the matter?

21:44.610 --> 21:47.530
Sensei, if you can make predictions, please tell me!

21:47.530 --> 21:50.120
I'm scared because I might hurt someone!

21:50.120 --> 21:56.620
I have heard that it is a greater sin to invite pain than to hurt.

22:00.380 --> 22:04.210
Hmm, I see. You're good.

22:05.800 --> 22:09.640
I'm going to watch how you do things, Noin.

22:28.610 --> 22:35.200
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.780 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.120
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.580 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.210 --> 23:30.130
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:48.110 --> 23:50.530
Jeanne, I'm going to protect you.

23:50.530 --> 23:51.780
Stop it, Sinbad!

23:52.660 --> 23:54.870
I won't believe the words of the Devil's servant!

23:54.870 --> 23:58.160
I don't care what you think of me! Maron, I'm going to protect you.

23:58.160 --> 24:02.710
Maron...?! Sinbad, did you just call me "Maron?!"

24:02.710 --> 24:06.040
Who...are you really?!

24:06.040 --> 24:09.710
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Sinbad the Liar!!

24:09.710 --> 24:12.590
Answer me! You couldn't actually be...?!
